price increase, and I would tell you, individually some markets actually improved greater than the average.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2018-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dave Powers","x":"Our backlogs in this business are good, however, and we've announced price increases in several of our markets for January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2018-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Colin","x":"Have you seen any of your competitors announced similar price increases that you're discussing for the calendar year in 2019?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2018-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Powers","x":"And we're rightsizing our business as we speak to make that happen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2018-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Powers","x":"Well, as I mentioned earlier, our plan is to rightsize the business and to become cash breakeven in the next several quarters and we are doing what it takes to get that done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2019-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David B. Powers","x":"It is against this backdrop that we've announced price increases in all of our cement and wallboard markets for early in calendar 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q3-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2019-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David B. Powers","x":"Moving to the Light Materials sector, lower sales volume, associated with the shift in timing of our wallboard price increase and related buying activity drove a 5% decline in our quarterly comparative of wallboard and paperboard revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q3-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2019-05-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Powers","x":"Our volumes do remain strong but our first quarter price increase was not successful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/16/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2019-05-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"We have cement price increases across all of our markets that were being implemented in April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/16/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2019 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2019-05-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Haack","x":"Through diligent engineering, we were able to select an option that also yielded significant power cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/16/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q1","e":"exp","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Haack","x":"This month, we announced a price increase in Wallboard effective in early August as backlogs are good, but the marketplace will determine our level of success and we will report on that in the next earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q1","e":"exp","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Haack","x":"I was quite pleased with the price increases in our cement business attained in each of our regions except two and lack of progress in those two regions affected the overall price progression that we posted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"Yeah, I would say, it's always a competitive market, but we had price increases that went into effect in April across the majority of our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Haack","x":"Yeah with all of our price increases we evaluate all the markets we participate in and we will have those discussions with our customers and determined by market by market basis of what those increases will be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2020-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Haack","x":"We do have price increases out across all markets in Wallboard and in Cement as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2020-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Haack","x":"Trey, when we look at it, we're out in all of our markets with the Cement price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2020-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"There was a few markets that we're able to give some -- the price increases were enacted but for the majority of the markets that's correct.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/19/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2020 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2020-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"And as you may recall, we have the ability within our paper mill to pass through those incremental costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/19/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q1","e":"exp","d":"2020-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"And those -- as those prices rise, we have a quarterly lag in which we've been pass-through those costs through the ultimate paper customer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q1","e":"exp","d":"2020-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"We've implemented our price increase and we've implemented those with customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"Against this backdrop, we have announced a Wallboard price increase to be implemented next week.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"Yes, look, the price increase is -- will be implemented early next week, early November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2021-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Craig Kesler","x":"As we've highlighted in the earnings release, the quarterly average Wallboard price doesn't fully reflect the price increase that was implemented in this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2021-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"Typically in the industries, cement price increase has come in the early summer or late spring timeframe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2021-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"With regards to Wallboard, subsequent to the quarter, we implemented a price increase effective in April and have announced a further price increase for June.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/19/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2021 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2021-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"For cement, we have implemented a price increase in April across our network and announced a second price increase in Texas for mid-summer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/19/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2022 Q1","e":"exp","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"The price increases range from $6 to $8 per ton and were effective in most markets in early April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2022 Q1","e":"exp","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Kesler","x":"These price increases were partially offset by lower cement sales volume, which was largely the result of heavy rainfall in Texas and reduced inventory levels across our cement network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2022 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Haack","x":"We have announced double-digit cement price increases effective January one across the majority of our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2022 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Craig Kesler","x":"The price increases range from $6 to $8 per ton and were effective in most markets in early April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/eagle-materials-inc-exp-q2-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EXP 2025 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2025-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"In terms of tariffs on cement imports, TBD, of course, but it would certainly impact the cost of imported product into the U.S., not necessarily a dramatic impact to us directly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/eagle-materials-exp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2025 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2025-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Philip Ng","x":"And then separately, if there are any tariffs potentially being implemented on cement, how do you think that actually impacts your business clear or bad?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/eagle-materials-exp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2025 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2025-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"In our heavy materials sector, which includes our Cement and Concrete and Aggregates segments, revenue declined 4%, primarily because of lower cement sales volume, partially offset by cement sales price increases we implemented earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/eagle-materials-exp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2025 Q3","e":"exp","d":"2025-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"As Michael mentioned, we have cement price increases announced in nearly all of our markets for the first part of calendar '25.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/eagle-materials-exp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2026 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2026-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"We have cement price increases in just about every market for April 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/eagle-materials-exp-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2026 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2026-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"We have a June 1 price increase in Wallboard.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/eagle-materials-exp-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2026 Q4","e":"exp","d":"2026-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"And those cost savings will be very, very meaningful part of that improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/eagle-materials-exp-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2027 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Kesler","x":"I think Michael mentioned, we do have price increases in most of our cement markets that have been announced for early January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/eagle-materials-exp-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2027 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Haack","x":"As a result, in cement and aggregates, we have communicated price increases to our customers for most of our markets effective January 1, 2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/eagle-materials-exp-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2027 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Haack","x":"By the later part of fiscal 2028, many of the cost savings we've highlighted before will be accretive to the margin profile of our Mountain Cement plant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/eagle-materials-exp-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EXP 2027 Q2","e":"exp","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Haack","x":"Achieving the full 25% cost savings does require selling the full capacity of the new plant, which will take several years to complete.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/eagle-materials-exp-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,4317,0,0,0,2817,1027],[34,1,5395,0,0,0,3206,1663],[35,1,3937,0,0,0,2511,1020],[36,1,5225,0,0,0,2969,1756],[37,1,6083,0,0,0,3058,2526],[38,1,5581,0,0,0,3366,1739],[39,1,5164,0,0,0,3484,1295],[40,1,4816,0,0,0,3208,1184],[41,1,7848,0,0,0,5652,1694],[42,1,6826,0,0,0,5191,1206],[43,1,4870,0,0,0,3506,1012],[44,1,6577,0,0,0,4681,1474],[45,1,7607,0,0,0,5527,1595],[46,1,6022,0,0,0,4392,1192],[47,1,5769,0,0,0,3883,1435],[60,1,4786,0,0,0,2157,2413],[65,1,4929,0,0,0,2546,2180],[67,1,3283,0,0,0,1333,1766]],"cinema":[[33,1,4317,0,0,0,2817,1027],[34,1,5395,0,0,0,3206,1663],[35,1,3937,0,0,0,2511,1020],[36,1,5225,0,0,0,2969,1756],[37,1,6083,0,0,0,3058,2526],[38,1,5581,0,0,0,3366,1739],[39,1,5164,0,0,0,3484,1295],[40,1,4816,0,0,0,3208,1184],[41,1,7848,0,0,0,5652,1694],[42,1,6826,0,0,0,5191,1206],[43,1,4870,0,0,0,3506,1012],[44,1,6577,0,0,0,4681,1474],[45,1,7607,0,0,0,5527,1595],[46,1,6022,0,0,0,4392,1192],[47,1,5769,0,0,0,3883,1435],[60,1,4786,0,0,0,2157,2413],[65,1,4929,0,0,0,2546,2180],[67,1,3283,0,0,0,1333,1766]],"imax":[[33,1,4317,0,0,0,2817,1027],[34,1,5395,0,0,0,3206,1663],[35,1,3937,0,0,0,2511,1020],[36,1,5225,0,0,0,2969,1756],[37,1,6083,0,0,0,3058,2526],[38,1,5581,0,0,0,3366,1739],[39,1,5164,0,0,0,3484,1295],[40,1,4816,0,0,0,3208,1184],[41,1,7848,0,0,0,5652,1694],[42,1,6826,0,0,0,5191,1206],[43,1,4870,0,0,0,3506,1012],[